  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled sweet potato into 1cm-thick fries. Peel the apple and cut into 2cm chunks. Halve the haloumi lengthwise, then halve widthwise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310776/photos/large/prep_ingredients-a341d0225e11aa799170c78b199fcab3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make sweet potato fries: Put the sweet potato on the lined tray, drizzle with 2 tsp olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Roast, turning halfway, for 18-20 mins until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310777/photos/large/make_sweet_potato_fries-e9cb58ceeea6966017c9f346faddc98a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make relish: Meanwhile, melt 20g butter in a small saucepan over medium heat. Cook the apple, stirring regularly, for 5 mins or until softened. Add the cranberries, ½ tsp cinnamon, 1 tbs balsamic vinegar, 1 tbs honey and 1 tbs water. Reduce the heat to low and cook, stirring occasionally, for 3-4 mins until caramelised. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310778/photos/large/make_relish-1ff5bf95671a60fbc67f0367e2ab8a7d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pan-fry haloumi: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the haloumi for 1-2 mins each side until golden. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310779/photos/large/pan_fry_haloumi-321e60561e47c14e882a0bf67299a427.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm buns and serve up: Cut the buns in half and put, cut side up, on an oven tray. Bake for 5 mins or until warmed through. Spread the bun bases and tops with 1 tbs mayonnaise, then layer with half the rocket, the haloumi and relish. Sandwich with the bun tops. Serve with the sweet potato fries and remaining rocket (see Make it yours) and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310780/photos/large/warm_buns_and_serve_up-e1a945e2a72ec27ec5a65723b24e7713.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Fancy a quick dressing? Toss the remaining rocket with a little balsamic vinegar and olive oil, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/310781/photos/large/make_it_yours-647e480239636cb28b069781e9fc82d1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
